      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup (about 10 minutes)\n1. Make a sheet tab **Jobs** with the headers in `sheet-headers.csv`. Phone numbers in international format (+15551234567).\n2. Open **Settings**: your business name, Twilio number, sheet URL.\n3. Connect Twilio and Google Sheets. US numbers need A2P 10DLC registration in Twilio before texting.\n4. Only text people who agreed to receive texts, and honour STOP replies. Run once with your own number, then switch to **Active**.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 7
